  "2026-10-19T19:08:26.125Z","harness:codex","Adopted pinned78.0.0 after the exact19:03:18.376Z age boundary using per-invocation pnpm_config_minimum_release_age=10080 and strict=true, verified in effective config. The generated lock adds28 registry package identities and removes only77.0.0; every addition is at least7.001 days old and matches registry integrity. All minimum Node22.18 engines and the four configured rule implementations qualify. Linked strict lint, all four TypeScript projects and dependency/source/native-payload audit pass; frozen install is unchanged. Runtime lock retains42 packages. Base artifact admission passes: distribution19292249 <=20000000 bytes, separately accounted runtime bundle23402553 bytes. No lint rule, exclusion, warning budget or package-size gate changed. Final reviewed delivery CI remains required."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T19:08:27.070Z","harness:codex","Use verified per-invocation resolver aging for a timed admission and independently authenticate every added registry identity. A major lint provider can expand its transitive closure even when the configured rule set is unchanged; validate that closure, runtime floor and actual packaged payload before accepting it."
